# ---- The same English in two areas with other words (strings.mjs check). Only where the two are different things on purpose.
same:Quiet | a mode name (Settings, "Tysta") and a built-in layout name (settings.layout_quiet, "Tyst"); the stored layout name is looked up by name
same:Full | a mode name (settings.mode_full, "Maximal") and a card level (common.full, "Allt")

# ---- The engines and the commands. English by rule, file by file.
file:core/shellrun.ts | an engine file: the English text twin of a slash command, notes to Claude, tool descriptions or a program; what it sends to the band, a toast or the ledger is stored English and said where it is shown (rows of area engines, tests/sv-engines.test.ts)
file:core/syswords.ts | the table of Windows words: each key is the Mac line, each value its Windows line; the pane's Swedish for the shown ones is in the rows (areas sys and engines), the rest is the English text twin or goes to Claude
