# ---- rows kept on purpose: the check cannot see them used, but the line is put together at run time
built:engines. | engine lines said again in the language of the draw by their shape (trFill templates), and ledger texts built from parts
built:band. | band lines built from counts and names, said by their shape
built:pane. | pane lines and ledger titles said by their English (core/ledger.ts shownTitle turns a stored title into the shown one, then tr finds the row)
built:toast. | toast lines built from names and counts
built:needs. | Needs you lines built from a name and a reason
built:cardhome. | the Home cards' lines built from counts
built:cardship. | the Ship and Context cards' lines built from counts and names
built:cardcompact. | the This session card's lines built from counts
built:cardcontext. | the Context card's lines built from sizes
built:cardcomputer. | the Computer card's lines built from numbers
built:glance. | Glance headlines built from counts
built:explain. | what-is-this lines built from a name
built:runcost. | the task run cost lines built from amounts
built:talk. | the talk lines built from a session name
built:guard.what_n_times | built from a title and a count
built:skills.all_used_this_week | the end of a Skills line built from parts
built:skills.top | the start of a Skills line built from parts
built:access.name_selected | the spoken name of a selected row, built from the name
built:truth.a_passed | built from a count
built:common.builder_model | the role label plus " model" (core/orchestra.ts)
built:common.fixer_model | the role label plus " model" (core/orchestra.ts)
built:common.researcher_model | the role label plus " model" (core/orchestra.ts)
built:common.reviewer_model | the role label plus " model" (core/orchestra.ts)
